.SH バージョン
A version of \fBptsname_r\fP()  is documented on Tru64, HP\-UX, and FreeBSD, but
on those implementations, \-1 is returned on error, with \fIerrno\fP set to
indicate the error.  Avoid using this function in portable programs.
.SH 標準規格
.TP 
